<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/auth"><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: enable;"><label for="field-UID">Enable Authentication</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="enable" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Enable Authentication</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Enable or disable the authentication system for the admin dashboard.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: usePasskeys;"><label for="field-UID">Use Passkeys</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="usePasskeys" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Use Passkeys</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Enable or disable passkey authentication for logging in and managing passkeys in user profiles.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: loginWith;"><label for="field-UID">Login With</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="loginWith" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="both" selected>Both</option><option value="email">Email Only</option><option value="id">Username Only</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Control what users can use to sign in. 'Email' requires an email address, 'Username' requires a user ID, and 'Both' allows either.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: collection;"><label for="field-UID">Default User Collection</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="collection" placeholder="auth" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="auth" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The ID of the default collection that stores user data.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: maxAttempts;"><label for="field-UID">Maximum Login Attempts</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="maxAttempts" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="10" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="10" min="1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of failed login attempts before the user is temporarily locked out.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: downloadMaxAttempts;"><label for="field-UID">Maximum Download Attempts</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="downloadMaxAttempts" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="25" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="25" min="1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of download attempts per session for file downloads before access is denied.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: deniedTimeout;"><label for="field-UID">Lockout Duration (Minutes)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="deniedTimeout" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="7" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="7" min="1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Number of minutes a user is locked out after exceeding maximum login attempts.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: deniedDefaultRedirect;"><label for="field-UID">Denied Access Redirect</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="deniedDefaultRedirect" placeholder="/" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="/" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The path to redirect users to when access is denied.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: persistentLoginDays;"><label for="field-UID">Persistent Login Duration (Days)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="persistentLoginDays" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="30" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="30" min="1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Number of days to keep user signed in when 'Keep me signed in' is checked.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: forgotPasswordMailerId;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;mailer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Password Reset Email Template</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="forgotPasswordMailerId" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled selected>Select a mailer template</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Optional custom mailer ID for password reset emails. Leave empty to use the default template.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: resetTokenExpiry;"><label for="field-UID">Reset Token Expiry (Minutes)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="resetTokenExpiry" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="30" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="30" min="5" max="120" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Number of minutes before a password reset token expires.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: verificationMailerId;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;mailer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Email Verification Template</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="verificationMailerId" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled selected>Select a mailer template</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Optional custom mailer ID for email verification messages sent to newly registered users. Leave empty to use the default template.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: verificationTokenExpiry;"><label for="field-UID">Verification Token Expiry (Minutes)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="verificationTokenExpiry" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="1440" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="1440" min="30" max="10080" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Number of minutes before an email verification token expires. Verification links typically live longer than password resets since users may not check their email for a day or two.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: publicRegistrationGroup;" data-settings="{&quot;accessGroupOptions&quot;:true}"><label for="field-UID">Public Registration Group</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="publicRegistrationGroup" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled selected>No access group</option><option value="admin">admin</option><option value="blogger">blogger</option><option value="default">default</option><option value="editor">editor</option><option value="limited-blogger">limited-blogger</option><option value="viewer">viewer</option><option value="schema-editor">schema-editor</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Access group automatically assigned to users created through public registration. Leave empty to assign no group. Any group submitted in the registration form is always ignored — only this value is honored.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>